"target_pin":"at 20","status":"verified","target_quote":"acknowledges that the pleading defects raised in the MTD","line":6,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-077-1-1-1-b0923cc5","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":20,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"DDC-077","src_page":"1","text":"ECF 74 at 41","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-074","target_page":"41","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"at 41","status":"verified","target_quote":"The contrary authority the motion collects holds only that the defect cannot be cured by amending the same complaint; none holds the claim extinguished.","line":7,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-077-1-1-1-9dbc582f","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":41,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"DDC-077","src_page":"1","text":"ECF 74 at 41","n":"2","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-074","target_page":"41","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"at 41","status":"verified","target_quote":"The contrary authority the motion collects holds only that the defect cannot be cured by amending the same complaint; none holds the claim extinguished.","line":8,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-077-1-2-1-9dbc582f","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":41,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"DDC-077","src_page":"1","text":"17 U.S.C. § 411(a)","n":"1","kind":"statute","target_doc":"usc-17-chapter-004-copyright-notice-deposit-and-registration","target_page":"248","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"§ 411(a)","status":"verified","target_quote":"(a) Except for an action brought for a violation of the rights of the author under section 106A(a), and subject to the provisions of subsection (b),1 no civil action for infringement of the copyright in any United States work shall be instituted until preregistration or registration of the copyright claim has been made in accordance with this title. In any case, however, where the deposit, application, and fee required for registration have been delivered to the Copyright Office in proper form and registration has been refused, the applicant is entitled to institute a civil action for infringement if notice thereof, with a copy of the complaint, is served on the Register of Copyrights. The Register may, at his or her option, become a party to the action with respect to the issue of registrability of the copyright claim by entering an appearance within sixty days after such service, but the Register's failure to become a party shall not deprive the court of jurisdiction to determine that issue.","line":9,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-077-1-1-1-6fa7cb7c","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":248,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"DDC-077","src_page":"1","text":"ECF 75","n":"2","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-075","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"ECF 75","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":10,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-077-1-2-1-a8510178","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-077","src_page":"1","text":"ECF 75 at 8 n.1","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-075","target_page":"8","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"at 8 n.1","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":11,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-077-1-1-1-d310af19","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":8,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-077","src_page":"1","text":"ECF No. 57","n":"1","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-057","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"ECF No. 57","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":12,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-077-1-1-1-7f0029f1","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-077","src_page":"1","text":"ECF No. 70-1","n":"2","kind":"ecf","target_doc":"DDC-070-01","target_page":"1","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"ECF No. 70-1","status":"verified","target_quote":"","line":13,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-077-1-2-1-e165e333","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page":1,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":null},{"src_doc":"DDC-077","src_page":"2","text":"Reed Elsevier, Inc. v. Muchnick, 559 U.S. 154, 157 (2010)","n":"1","kind":"case","target_doc":"2010 - Reed Elsevier v. Muchnick, 559 U.S. 154","target_page":"157","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"559 U.S. at 157","status":"verified","target_quote":"In this case, the Court of Appeals for the Second Circuit held that a copyright holder's failure to comply with § 411(a)'s registration requirement deprives a federal court of jurisdiction to adjudicate his copyright infringement claim. We disagree. Section 411(a)'s registration requirement is a precondition to filing a claim that does not restrict a federal court's subject-matter jurisdiction","line":14,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-077-2-1-1-f733dd33","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":4,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":null,"target_columns":[]},{"src_doc":"DDC-077","src_page":"2","text":"17 U.S.C. § 507(b)","n":"1","kind":"statute","target_doc":"usc-17-chapter-005-copyright-infringement-and-remedies","target_page":"","target_page_end":"","target_pin":"§ 507(b)","status":"verified","target_quote":"three years after the claim accrued","line":15,"k":1,"unit_id":"DDC-077-2-1-1-6d5b928d","violations":[],"warnings":[],"src_pdf_page":2,"target_pdf_page":262,"target_pdf_page_end":null,"target_known":true,"target_pin_page":{"pdf":262,"by":"section","